# The paper bandpowers are small and are the point of this branch: keep them.
!results/**/*.npz
!data_paper/masking_radius_null_test/*.npz

# Likewise every paper data product under data_paper/: bandpowers, theory
# covariances and null-test caches together are ~1.4 MB, and they are what the
# figures and chains are actually built from.
!data_paper/**/*.npy
!data_paper/**/*.npz
!data_paper/**/*.csv

